{"id":"wb-6-459","name":"王家大院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"王家大院 (灵石县)","text":"王家大院位于山西省晋中市灵石县城东12公里处的中国历史文化名镇静升镇，是中国最大的民居建筑之一，也是山西最大的一座保存完好的建筑群。该院是清代民居建筑的重要代表，在2006年入选全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%B6%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%A2_(%E7%81%B5%E7%9F%B3%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":95205074,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95205074","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2e2e3d390d046658e339c274.jpg","title":"Lingshi_Jingsheng_Wangjia_Dayuan_2013.08.24_13-35-03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lingshi_Jingsheng_Wangjia_Dayuan_2013.08.24_13-35-03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/Lingshi_Jingsheng_Wangjia_Dayuan_2013.08.24_13-35-03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"灵石静升王家大院 ——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}